cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Fish Pond in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Fish Pond: interactive 3D fish behaviour experiments"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Fish Pond is a set of browser experiments about how an artificial fish decides what to do:
  a cognitive arena contrasting instinct and deliberation, a three-way controller benchmark,
  and a realistic Triforge-shaded underwater scene with a full settings sidebar.
version: 0.2.1
date-released: "2026-10-01"
url: "https://fish-pond-mu.vercel.app"
repository-code: "https://github.com/AftabIbrahimKazi/fish-pond"
authors:
